i.org/10.1093/molehr/gau116)\\] \\[[PubMed](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25542835/)\\] \\[[Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Mol%20Hum%20Reprod&title=Identification%20of%20a%20human%20subcortical%20maternal%20complex&author=K%20Zhu&author=L%20Yan&author=X%20Zhang&volume=21&publication_year=2015&pages=320-9&pmid=25542835&doi=10.1093/molehr/gau116&)\\]\n-   5.Li L, Baibakov B, Dean J. A subcortical maternal complex essential for preimplantation mouse embryogenesis. Dev Cell. 2008;15:416–25. doi: 10.1016/j.devcel.2008.07.010. \\[[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2008.07.010)\\] \\[[PMC free article](/articles/PMC2597058/)\\] \\[[PubMed](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/18804437/)\\] \\[[Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Dev%20Cell&title=A%20subcortical%20maternal%20complex%20essential%20for%20preimplantation%20mouse%20embryogenesis&author=L%20Li&author=B%20Baibakov&author=J%20Dean&volume=15&publication_year=2008&pages=416-25&pmid=18804437&doi=10.1016/j.devcel.2008.07.010&)\\]\n-   6.Meyer E, Lim D, Pasha S, et al. Germline mutation in NLRP2 (NALP2) in a familial imprinting disorder (Beckwith-Wiedemann Syndrome) PLoS Genet. 2009;5:e1000423. doi: 10.1371/journal.pgen.1000423. \\[[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pgen.1000423)\\] \\[[PMC free article](/articles/PMC2650258/)\\] \\[[PubMed](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19300480/)\\] \\[[Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=PLoS%20Genet&title=Germline%20mutation%20in%20NLRP2%20\\(NALP2\\)%20in%20a%20familial%20imprinting%20disorder%20\\(Beckwith-Wiedemann%20Syndrome\\)&author=E%20Meyer&author=D%20Lim&author=S%20Pasha&volume=5&publication_year=2009&pages=e1000423&pmid=19300480&doi=10.1371/journal.pgen.1000423&)\\]\n-   7.Docherty LE, Rezwan FI, Poole RL, et al. Mutations in NLRP5 are associated with reproductive wastage and multilocus imprinting disorders in humans. Nat Commun. 2015;6:8086. doi: 10.1038/ncomms9086. \\[[D