[Collections icon](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/674d4f95/var/data/static/img/action-bookmark-empty.svg)\n-   ![Cite icon](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/674d4f95/var/data/static/img/format_quote.svg)\n-   ![Show article permalink icon](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/674d4f95/var/data/static/img/share.svg)\n    \n    ## PERMALINK\n    \n     ![Copy icon](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/674d4f95/var/data/static/img/content_copy.svg) Copy\n    \n\n![Open article navigation icon](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/674d4f95/var/data/static/img/list.svg)\n\nAs a library, NLM provides access to scientific literature. Inclusion in an NLM database does not imply endorsement of, or agreement with, the contents by NLM or the National Institutes of Health.  \nLearn more: [PMC Disclaimer](/about/disclaimer/) | [PMC Copyright Notice](/about/copyright/)\n\n![American Journal of Human Genetics logo](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/banners/logo-ajhg.png)\n\nAm J Hum Genet\n\n. 2016 Aug 18;99(3):744–752. doi: [10.1016/j.ajhg.2016.06.024](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ajhg.2016.06.024)\n\n-   [Search in PMC](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/search/?term=\"Am%20J%20Hum%20Genet\"[jour])\n-   [Search in PubMed](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=\"Am%20J%20Hum%20Genet\"[jour])\n-   [View in NLM Catalog](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nlmcatalog?term=\"Am%20J%20Hum%20Genet\"[Title%20Abbreviation])\n-   [Add to search](?term=\"Am%20J%20Hum%20Genet\"[jour])\n\n# Mutations in *PADI6* Cause Female Infertility Characterized by Early Embryonic Arrest\n\n[Yao Xu](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=\"Xu%20Y\"[Author])\n\n### Yao Xu\n\n1Obstetrics and Gynecology Hospital, Fudan University, Shanghai 200011, China\n\n2State Key Laboratory of Genetic Engineering and Ministry of Education Key Laboratory of