{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778977432136,"sessionID":"ses_1ccaf3743ffeQMnyfWaPxDVgzw","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"webfetch","callID":"call_4oBCSKjQkgakfh4Ux3bZNKbm","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/medgen/?term=617234","format":"markdown","timeout":120},"output":"     Oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16 (Concept Id: C4310659) - MedGen - NCBI      \n\n**Warning:** The NCBI web site requires JavaScript to function. [more...](/guide/browsers/#enablejs \"Learn how to enable JavaScript\")\n\n![U.S. flag](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/coreutils/uswds/img/favicons/favicon-57.png)\n\nAn official website of the United States government\n\nHere's how you know\n\n![Dot gov](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/coreutils/uswds/img/icon-dot-gov.svg)\n\n**The .gov means it's official.**  \nFederal government websites often end in .gov or .mil. Before sharing sensitive information, make sure you're on a federal government site.\n\n![Https](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/coreutils/uswds/img/icon-https.svg)\n\n**The site is secure.**  \nThe **https://** ensures that you are connecting to the official website and that any information you provide is encrypted and transmitted securely.\n\n[![NIH NLM Logo](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/coreutils/nwds/img/logos/AgencyLogo.svg)](/)\n\n[Log in](https://account.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov) Show account info\n\nClose\n\n#### Account\n\nLogged in as:  \n**username**\n\n-   [Dashboard](/myncbi/)\n-   [Publications](/myncbi/collections/bibliography/)\n-   [Account settings](/account/settings/)\n-   [Log out](/account/signout/)\n\n[Access keys](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/guide/browsers/#ncbi_accesskeys) [NCBI Homepage](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov) [MyNCBI Homepage](/myncbi/) [Main Content](#maincontent) [Main Navigation](#)\n\n# [MedGen](/medgen)\n\n## National Center for Biotechnology Information\n\nSearch databaseMedGenAll DatabasesAssemblyBiocollectionsBioProjectBioSampleBooksClinVarConserved DomainsdbGaPdbVarGeneGenomeGEO DataSetsGEO ProfilesGTRIdentical Protein GroupsMedGenMeSHNLM CatalogNucleotideOMIMPMCProteinProtein ClustersProtein Family ModelsPubChem BioAssayPubChem CompoundPubChem SubstancePubMedSNPSRAStructureTaxonomyToolKitToolKitAllToolKitBookgh\n\nSearch term\n\nSearch\n\n-   [Create alert](/sites/myncbi/searches/save?db=medgen&qk=1 \"Click to create an email alert for this search\")\n-   [Limits](/medgen/limits?term=617234)\n-   [Advanced](/medgen/advanced)\n-   [Help](/medgen/docs/overview/)\n\n-   [Full Report](#)\n\nFormat\n\n-   Full Report\n-   Summary (Text)\n-   Summary (XML)\n\nApply\n\n#### [Send to:](#) \n\nChoose Destination\n\n-   File\n-   Clipboard\n-   Collections\n\n-   FormatSummary (Text)Summary (XML)\n\nCreate File\n\nAdd to Clipboard\n\nAdd to Collections\n\nImage\n\n![Image from GeneReviews](/books/NBK614473/bin/mlid-maternal-Image001.gif)  \n[details](/books/NBK614473/figure/mlid-maternal.F1/ \"GeneReviews\")\n\n# \n\nOocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16(PREMBL2; OZEMA16)\n\nMedGen UID:\n\n934626\n\n•Concept ID:\n\n[C4310659](/medgen/docs/overview/#sources \"Concept Unique Identifier from NLM's Unified Medical Language system (UMLS)\nClick for more information.\")\n\n•\n\nDisease or Syndrome\n\nSynonym:\n\nPreimplantation embryonic lethality 2\n\n \n\n[Gene (location):![](//static.pubmed.gov/portal/portal3rc.fcgi/4232014/img/4204968)](#target-gene-loc)\n\nGene(s) directly associated with  \nthis condition or phenotype.\n\n[PADI6](/gene/353238 \"PADI6 - ID: 353238 - NCBI Gene\") (1p36.13)\n\n \n\nMonarch Initiative:\n\n[MONDO:1010200](https://monarchinitiative.org/disease/MONDO:1010200)\n\nOMIM®:\n\n[617234](https://omim.org/entry/617234)\n\n# Definition\n\n[](# \"Show/hide content\")\n\nAny inherited oocyte maturation defect marked by early embryonic arrest and female infertility due to a varition in the PADI6 gene. \\[from MONDO\\]\n\n# Clinical features\n\n[](# \"Show/hide content\")\n\n**From HPO**  \n\n**Infertility disorder**\n\nMedGen UID:\n\n43876\n\n•Concept ID:\n\n[C0021359](/medgen/docs/overview/#sources \"Concept Unique Identifier from NLM's Unified Medical Language system (UMLS)\nClick for more information.\")\n\n•\n\nFinding\n\nInability to conceive for at least one year after trying and having unprotected sex. Causes of female infertility include endometriosis, fallopian tubes obstruction, and polycystic ovary syndrome. Causes of male infertility include abnormal sperm production or function, blockage of the epididymis, blockage of the ejaculatory ducts, hypospadias, exposure to pesticides, and health related issues.\n\nSee: [Feature record](/medgen/43876) | [Search on this feature](/medgen?term=%22Infertility%20disorder%22%5BClinical%20Features%5D%20OR%2043876%5Buid%5D)\n\n**Preimplantation lethality**\n\nMedGen UID:\n\n1689832\n\n•Concept ID:\n\n[C5139371](/medgen/docs/overview/#sources \"Concept Unique Identifier from NLM's Unified Medical Language system (UMLS)\nClick for more information.\")\n\n•\n\nFinding\n\nIt is estimated that about 40-70 percent of human embryos produced in vitro fertilization (IVF) and intracytoplasmic sperm injection (ICSI) are viable embryos, whereas others arrest at different early stages of development. The phenotype of preimplantation lethality is inferred if IVF and ICSI cycles fail because all of an individual's embryos are arrested at early stages of development.\n\nSee: [Feature record](/medgen/1689832) | [Search on this feature](/medgen?term=%22Preimplantation%20lethality%22%5BClinical%20Features%5D%20OR%201689832%5Buid%5D)\n\n[Show all](#)[Hide all](#)\n\n-   Abnormality of prenatal development or birth\n    -   [Preimplantation lethality](#clin_1689832 \"click for more information\")\n-   Urogenital tract malformation\n    -   [Infertility disorder](#clin_43876 \"click for more information\")\n\n# Term Hierarchy\n\n[](# \"Show/hide content\")\n\n-   [GTR](#tabGTR)\n-   [MeSH](#tabMGEN)\n\nCClinical test,  RResearch test,  OOMIM,  G*GeneReviews*,  VClinVar  \n\n-   [Inherited oocyte maturation defect](/medgen/893170 \"View MedGen record for 'Inherited oocyte maturation defect'\")\n    -   [C](/gtr/tests/?term=C4014291[DISCUI]&test_type=Clinical)R[O](/omim/195000)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=862728)[Female infertility due to zona pellucida defect](/medgen/862728 \"View MedGen record for 'Female infertility due to zona pellucida defect'\")\n    -   [C](/gtr/tests/?term=C4225210[DISCUI]&test_type=Clinical)R[O](/omim/616768)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=903836)[Oocyte maturation defect 2](/medgen/903836 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 2'\")\n    -   [C](/gtr/tests/?term=C4540205[DISCUI]&test_type=Clinical&redirect=true)R[O](/omim/182889)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1617317)[Oocyte maturation defect 3](/medgen/1617317 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 3'\")\n    -   [C](/gtr/tests/?term=C4540284[DISCUI]&test_type=Clinical&redirect=true)R[O](/omim/614661)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1616340)[Oocyte maturation defect 4](/medgen/1616340 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 4'\")\n    -   [C](/gtr/tests/?term=C4693865[DISCUI]&test_type=Clinical&redirect=true)R[O](/omim/614084)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1644330)[Oocyte maturation defect 5](/medgen/1644330 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 5'\")\n    -   [C](/gtr/tests/?term=C5193047[DISCUI]&test_type=Clinical&redirect=true)R[O](/omim/182888)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1682649)[Oocyte maturation defect 6](/medgen/1682649 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 6'\")\n    -   CR[O](/omim/608420)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1684736)[Oocyte maturation defect 7](/medgen/1684736 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 7'\")\n    -   CR[O](/omim/605673)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1776094)[Oocyte maturation defect 8](/medgen/1776094 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 8'\")\n    -   [C](/gtr/tests/?term=C5436599[DISCUI]&test_type=Clinical&redirect=true)R[O](/omim/604507)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1724427)[Oocyte maturation defect 9](/medgen/1724427 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 9'\")\n    -   CR[O](/omim/618421)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1766720)[Oocyte maturation defect 10](/medgen/1766720 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 10'\")\n    -   CR[O](/omim/608860)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1794243)[Oocyte maturation defect 11](/medgen/1794243 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 11'\")\n    -   CR[O](/omim/609110)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1794273)[Oocyte maturation defect 12](/medgen/1794273 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 12'\")\n    -   CR[O](/omim/603618)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1840962)[Oocyte maturation defect 14](/medgen/1840962 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte maturation defect 14'\")\n    -   [C](/gtr/tests/?term=C4310659[DISCUI]&test_type=Clinical)R[O](/omim/610363)[G](/books/NBK614473/)[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=934626)Oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16\n    -   [C](/gtr/tests/?term=C5830418[DISCUI]&test_type=Clinical&redirect=true)R[O](/omim/614107)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=1841054)[Oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 17](/medgen/1841054 \"View MedGen record for 'Oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 17'\")\n    -   CR[O](/omim/612399)G[V](/clinvar?LinkName=medgen_clinvar&from_uid=896351)[Preimplantation embryonic lethality 1](/medgen/896351 \"View MedGen record for 'Preimplantation embryonic lethality 1'\")\n\n-   [Inherited oocyte maturation defect](/medgen/893170 \"MedGen record for Inherited oocyte maturation defect\")\n    -   Oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16\n\nThese guidelines are articles in PubMed that match specific search criteria devel