{"type":"text","timestamp":1778977442018,"sessionID":"ses_1ccaf3743ffeQMnyfWaPxDVgzw","part":{"id":"prt_e33516e1a001TVdbxK4SOIc1TU","messageID":"msg_e335162b7001X7Wz3ksqUJk0yx","sessionID":"ses_1ccaf3743ffeQMnyfWaPxDVgzw","type":"text","text":"The external sources confirm the core concept: PMCIDs map to `PMID:27545678` and `PMID:29693651`, MedGen/OMIM use `oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16` for `OMIM:617234`, and the older MONDO handling appears stale/obsolete. I’m checking whether a current MONDO ID already exists for this concept before deciding between updating an existing stanza and minting a new `MONDO:777xxxx` term.","time":{"start":1778977435163,"end":1778977442015}}}
