otation cycle, so their versions may not match the RefSeq versions in the current genome build. Identify version mismatches by comparing the version of the RefSeq in this section to the one reported in [Genomic regions, transcripts, and products](#geneGenomic regions, transcripts, and products) above.\n\n#### Genomic\n\n1.  NG\\_032943.2 RefSeqGene\n    \n    Range\n    \n    4951..34454\n    \n    Download\n    \n    [GenBank](/nuccore/NG_032943.2?from=4951&to=34454&report=genbank), [FASTA](/nuccore/NG_032943.2?from=4951&to=34454&report=fasta), [Sequence Viewer (Graphics)](/nuccore/NG_032943.2?from=525&to=38878&report=graph&content=5)\n    \n\n#### mRNA and Protein(s)\n\n1.  [NM\\_207421.4](/nuccore/NM_207421.4) → [NP\\_997304.3](/protein/NP_997304.3)  inactive protein-arginine deiminase type-6\n    \n    [See identical proteins and their annotated locations for NP\\_997304.3](/ipg/NP_997304.3/)\n    \n    Status: REVIEWED\n    \n    Source sequence(s)\n    \n    [AY422079, AY443100](/nuccore/AY422079, AY443100)\n    \n    Consensus CDS\n    \n    [CCDS72715.1](/CCDS/CcdsBrowse.cgi?REQUEST=CCDS&GO=MainBrowse&DATA=CCDS72715.1)\n    \n    UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot\n    \n    [Q330K5](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprot/Q330K5), [Q6TGC4](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprot/Q6TGC4), [Q70SX3](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprot/Q70SX3)\n    \n    Related\n    \n    [ENSP00000483125.1](http://www.ensembl.org/id/ENSP00000483125.1), [ENST00000619609.1](http://www.ensembl.org/id/ENST00000619609.1)\n    \n    Conserved Domains (3) [summary](/Structure/cdd/wrpsb.cgi?seqinput=NP_997304.3)\n    \n    [pfam03068](/Structure/cdd/cddsrv.cgi?uid=281113)  \n    Location:295 → 691\n    \n    PAD; Protein-arginine deiminase (PAD)\n    \n    [pfam08526](/Structure/cdd/cddsrv.cgi?uid=285698)  \n    Location:9 → 120\n    \n    PAD\\_N; Protein-arginine deiminase (PAD) N-terminal domain\n    \n    [pfam08527](/Structure/cdd/cddsrv.cgi?uid=285699)  \n    Location:122 → 280\n    \n    PAD\\_M; Protein-argin