{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778977823123,"sessionID":"ses_1ccaf3743ffeQMnyfWaPxDVgzw","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_8g0R7qGOuBewtBd1YE4hgwf5","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Added a new active MONDO term for `PADI6-related oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16 and maternal-effect disorder` and updated the obsolete legacy `preimplantation embryonic lethality 2` term to point to it via `replaced_by`.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+Implemented issue #9855 by adding a current MONDO term for the PADI6-associated infertility phenotype and rewiring the obsolete legacy term.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Added `MONDO:7770012` with label `PADI6-related oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16 and maternal-effect disorder`.\n+- Added definition, OMIM xref, requested/validated synonyms, and PADI6 gene relationship.\n+- Placed the new term under `MONDO:0014769` (`inherited oocyte maturation defect`) as requested and supported by existing MONDO structure.\n+- Updated obsolete `MONDO:0014978` (`obsolete preimplantation embryonic lethality 2`) to `replaced_by: MONDO:7770012` and recorded issue provenance.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The local ontology already contained an obsolete PADI6-related legacy term (`MONDO:0014978`) with `OMIM:617234`, but no active replacement term.\n+- The issue requested a current disease term using updated nomenclature and broader maternal-effect wording.\n+- Existing neighboring terms in this branch of the ontology use `inherited oocyte maturation defect` as the parent, so I followed that pattern.\n+\n+Identifier and literature validation performed:\n+- Validated the cited PMC articles and converted them to PubMed identifiers:\n+  - `PMC5010645` -> `PMID:27545678`\n+  - `PMC6018785` -> `PMID:29693651`\n+- Validated `OMIM:617234` / MedGen concept usage for `oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16` / `PREMBL2`.\n+- Validated human `PADI6` identifier as `HGNC:20449`.\n+\n+Checks completed:\n+- [x] Read imported issue context\n+- [x] Reviewed existing MONDO PADI6/oocyte maturation terms\n+- [x] Validated publication identifiers and gene identifier\n+- [x] Added the new active term\n+- [x] Updated the obsolete predecessor to point to the new term\n+- [x] Ran syntax validation with `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o src/ontology/mondo-edit.TMP.obo`\n+- [x] Reviewed final diff before commit\n+\n+Environment note:\n+- The repo guidance calls for Docker/ODK-based normalization (`make NORM` via `src/ontology/run.sh`), but Docker was not available in this environment, so I could not run normalization here.\n+- I did run a successful `robot convert` syntax check locally.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Added a new active MONDO term for `PADI6-related oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16 and maternal-effect disorder` and updated the obsolete legacy `preimplantation embryonic lethality 2` term to point to it via `replaced_by`.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@\n+Implemented issue #9855 by adding a current MONDO term for the PADI6-associated infertility phenotype and rewiring the obsolete legacy term.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Added `MONDO:7770012` with label `PADI6-related oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16 and maternal-effect disorder`.\n+- Added definition, OMIM xref, requested/validated synonyms, and PADI6 gene relationship.\n+- Placed the new term under `MONDO:0014769` (`inherited oocyte maturation defect`) as requested and supported by existing MONDO structure.\n+- Updated obsolete `MONDO:0014978` (`obsolete preimplantation embryonic lethality 2`) to `replaced_by: MONDO:7770012` and recorded issue provenance.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The local ontology already contained an obsolete PADI6-related legacy term (`MONDO:0014978`) with `OMIM:617234`, but no active replacement term.\n+- The issue requested a current disease term using updated nomenclature and broader maternal-effect wording.\n+- Existing neighboring terms in this branch of the ontology use `inherited oocyte maturation defect` as the parent, so I followed that pattern.\n+\n+Identifier and literature validation performed:\n+- Validated the cited PMC articles and converted them to PubMed identifiers:\n+  - `PMC5010645` -> `PMID:27545678`\n+  - `PMC6018785` -> `PMID:29693651`\n+- Validated `OMIM:617234` / MedGen concept usage for `oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16` / `PREMBL2`.\n+- Validated human `PADI6` identifier as `HGNC:20449`.\n+\n+Checks completed:\n+- [x] Read imported issue context\n+- [x] Reviewed existing MONDO PADI6/oocyte maturation terms\n+- [x] Validated publication identifiers and gene identifier\n+- [x] Added the new active term\n+- [x] Updated the obsolete predecessor to point to the new term\n+- [x] Ran syntax validation with `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o src/ontology/mondo-edit.TMP.obo`\n+- [x] Reviewed final diff before commit\n+\n+Environment note:\n+- The repo guidance calls for Docker/ODK-based normalization (`make NORM` via `src/ontology/run.sh`), but Docker was not available in this 