{"type":"text","timestamp":1778977838144,"sessionID":"ses_1ccaf3743ffeQMnyfWaPxDVgzw","part":{"id":"prt_e33577a1a001Ej5Tu70eJu8XX7","messageID":"msg_e3357710a001SrIeD2lcOuvJ86","sessionID":"ses_1ccaf3743ffeQMnyfWaPxDVgzw","type":"text","text":"Implemented issue #9855 and committed the ontology change locally as `01dbcef` with message `Add PADI6-related OZEMA16 term`.\n\nWhat changed:\n- Added new term `MONDO:7770012`:\n  - `PADI6-related oocyte/zygote/embryo maturation arrest 16 and maternal-effect disorder`\n- Added:\n  - definition\n  - `OMIM:617234` xref\n  - validated synonyms including `PREMBL2`\n  - `has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/20449 ! PADI6`\n  - parent `MONDO:0014769 ! inherited oocyte maturation defect`\n- Updated obsolete `MONDO:0014978` to:\n  - remain obsolete\n  - use `replaced_by: MONDO:7770012`\n  - carry issue provenance for `#9855`\n\nValidation:\n- Confirmed literature identifiers from the issue:\n  - `PMC5010645` -> `PMID:27545678`\n  - `PMC6018785` -> `PMID:29693651`\n- Confirmed `PADI6` human gene identifier:\n  - `HGNC:20449`\n- Ran syntax validation successfully with:\n  - `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o src/ontology/mondo-edit.TMP.obo`\n\nEnvironment limitation:\n- Docker was unavailable, so I could not run the repo’s Docker/ODK normalization step (`make NORM` via `run.sh`).\n\nCreated but did not commit:\n- `ISSUE_COMMENTS.md`\n- `PR_COMMENTS.md`","time":{"start":1778977831450,"end":1778977838142}}}
